# Only the Tier 1 and Tier 2 paths are listed, and there is no catch-all `*`.
# The ruleset (.github/rulesets/main.json) requires code owner review, so every
# path listed here needs the owner's approving review before it can merge, and
# a `*` line would extend that to every pull request. Tier 3 paths merge on the
# required checks. scripts/check-policies.mjs fails when an owner-review path is
# missing here or a `*` line comes back. docs/agent-boundaries.md explains it.

